<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ RoSE: Round-robin Synthetic Data Evaluation for Selecting LLM Generators without Human Test Sets" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Additional Visualisations and Tables</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
