<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Comparison of proxy metrics for selecting the best LLM generator per language. Bars show the average gap in mean F1 score for models trained on the best generator selected by metrics vs. the optimal generator (smaller is better). The best metric is green, the second best is orange, and the worst is red. RoSE is the best proxy metric in 9 of 11 languages, and 2nd best for the other 2 cases. RoSE performs well across all languages regardless of the amount of resources per language.</figcaption>
</figure>
